+## tool / material / machine, the three framings Option B distinguishes. Machines already have a casing
+## colour (`machine_icons`); tools are read from `MiningRules.is_tool_item`; anything else is a material.
+func _item_category_b(item: StringName) -> String:
+	if machine_icons.has(item):
